        "type": "p",
        "content": "Search engines like Google use page loading speed as a direct ranking signal (via Core Web Vitals). A slow website ranks lower, receives less search traffic, and converts fewer visitors. By building a high-speed, lightweight website, you improve search engine visibility and user experience, resulting in more bookings and leads."
